  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "After about 20 minutes in a session my movement looks very low FPS to everyone in the lobby but myself. Its not related to my wifi as others in the house dont suffer from this problem, it appears from my testing to be due to my motherboard having an older network chip. This low FPS bug happens to anybody after a long period of time but certain motherboards \"speed up\" the bug. Rejoining the world does temproarily fix it but doing it every 20 minutes is very annoying.\n\nIts increadibly distracting for other people and often causes motion sickness, not only that but due to everyone eventually suffering from this problem and not knowing the cause it can cause alot of issues.",
